OL,3,ASouth African airline behind daring
OL,4,Astadium stunt cancels next flyby,
OL,5,Aregulator says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe South African airline behind a
OL,8,Fdaring aerial stunt last Saturday that
OL,9,Fsaw two planes flying in close
OL,10,Fformation low over a packed stadium has
OL,11,Fpulled out of doing a similar operation
OL,12,Fthis weekend, the country's aviation
OL,13,Fregulator, SACAA, has said.
OL,15,FAirlink's flying feat divided opinion
OL,16,Fwith some labelling the startling
OL,17,Fmanoeuvre reckless, while others
OL,18,Fpraised the precision and expertise on
OL,19,Fdisplay.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31902
