OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASouth African airline behind daring
OL,4,Astadium stunt cancels next flyby,
OL,5,Aregulator says
OL,6,
OL,7,FSACAA said that while it had approved
OL,8,Fthe applications and safety measures
OL,9,Ffor the flybys, it was now
OL,10,Finvestigating further following
OL,11,F"discussions in the media".
OL,13,FAirlink has not commented on the
OL,14,Freported cancellation of Saturday's
OL,15,Fdisplay that had been due to place over
OL,16,Fa stadium in Soweto.
